1
00:01:26,545 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:35,025 --> 00:01:37,185
The mountains here are lush and beautiful.

3
00:01:37,265 --> 00:01:38,345
Mist curls around the peaks.

4
00:01:38,425 --> 00:01:41,105
From the valley floor,
it looks like a fairyland.

5
00:01:41,625 --> 00:01:44,585
The scenery in this painting

6
00:01:45,345 --> 00:01:47,585
really does resemble this valley.

7
00:01:48,145 --> 00:01:49,145
Then, Miss A-Luo...

8
00:01:49,625 --> 00:01:51,345
-Do you know of a kind of...
-Miss A-Luo.

9
00:01:52,225 --> 00:01:53,465
I noticed there are

10
00:01:53,545 --> 00:01:55,945
many flowers in the courtyard.
What are they for?

11
00:01:56,025 --> 00:01:58,305
Tomorrow is our valley's Flower Festival.

12
00:01:58,385 --> 00:02:00,585
I'm preparing flower cakes
for the festival.

13
00:02:01,145 --> 00:02:02,145
Please make yourselves comfortable.

14
00:02:02,225 --> 00:02:03,345
Have a good chat.

15
00:02:03,425 --> 00:02:04,425
If you need anything,

16
00:02:04,505 --> 00:02:05,945
just call for me.

17
00:02:13,065 --> 00:02:13,905
Lord Meng.

18
00:02:14,545 --> 00:02:17,265
I was about to ask about
where the Fuqing Grass grows. Why...?

19
00:02:17,345 --> 00:02:18,785
We only just arrived.

20
00:02:19,585 --> 00:02:21,225
If we bring up Fuqing Grass so soon,

21
00:02:21,305 --> 00:02:22,785
we may alert whoever is behind this.

22
00:02:23,345 --> 00:02:24,225
Lord Meng.

23
00:02:25,025 --> 00:02:27,145
Miss A-Luo is kind and guileless.

24
00:02:27,705 --> 00:02:29,985
She treated me when I was poisoned
by that snake.

25
00:02:30,065 --> 00:02:31,265
She and her brother depend
on each other.

26
00:02:31,345 --> 00:02:34,105
The villagers live almost entirely
cut off from the outside world.

27
00:02:34,185 --> 00:02:35,585
They rarely deal with outsiders.

28
00:02:36,145 --> 00:02:36,985
To be safe,

29
00:02:37,425 --> 00:02:39,145
we should investigate on our own first.

30
00:02:39,785 --> 00:02:40,945
Yin Qing.

31
00:02:41,025 --> 00:02:43,345
You know mountain terrain better than us.

32
00:02:43,425 --> 00:02:44,705
For this operation,

33
00:02:44,785 --> 00:02:46,665
-you arrange everyone's route.
-Yes.

34
00:02:47,225 --> 00:02:48,345
Your Majesty.

35
00:02:48,425 --> 00:02:50,105
Wangxian Valley has difficult terrain.

36
00:02:50,185 --> 00:02:52,265
Snakes, insects, and vermin
are common here.

37
00:02:52,345 --> 00:02:53,465
For safety's sake,

38
00:02:53,545 --> 00:02:54,385
I suggest

39
00:02:54,465 --> 00:02:56,225
we search in male-female pairs.

40
00:02:56,785 --> 00:02:58,105
I'll go with Zhili.

41
00:02:58,185 --> 00:02:59,225
Look how eager you are.

42
00:02:59,305 --> 00:03:01,385
Is Zhili your sister or mine?

43
00:03:01,465 --> 00:03:02,585
Then I...

44
00:03:02,665 --> 00:03:04,745
will reluctantly pair up with Miss Yan.

45
00:03:04,825 --> 00:03:06,225
You beat me to saying it.

46
00:03:06,305 --> 00:03:08,345
Who exactly is the reluctant one?
Explain yourself.

47
00:03:09,545 --> 00:03:10,785
A slip of the tongue.

48
00:03:10,865 --> 00:03:11,825
What I meant was,

49
00:03:11,905 --> 00:03:13,385
having the chance to protect Miss Yan

50
00:03:13,465 --> 00:03:14,345
is my honor.

51
00:03:15,105 --> 00:03:15,945
That's more like it.

52
00:03:17,305 --> 00:03:18,665
Then I'll go with my lord...

53
00:03:18,745 --> 00:03:20,465
Your martial arts are too poor.
You can't protect Lord Meng.

54
00:03:21,345 --> 00:03:22,665
I'll go with her tomorrow.

55
00:03:22,745 --> 00:03:24,105
Whatever you find,

56
00:03:24,185 --> 00:03:25,625
everyone must return before dark.

57
00:03:26,545 --> 00:03:27,385
What about me?

58
00:03:27,465 --> 00:03:28,465
Old Huang.

59
00:03:28,545 --> 00:03:30,265
You have an important role here.

60
00:03:32,345 --> 00:03:33,505
Old Huang.

61
00:03:33,585 --> 00:03:35,345
Spend more time talking with Miss A-Luo.

62
00:03:35,425 --> 00:03:37,825
-Get to know each other better.
-Don't talk nonsense.

63
00:03:37,905 --> 00:03:39,065
Old Huang.

64
00:03:39,145 --> 00:03:40,105
I mean,

65
00:03:40,185 --> 00:03:41,265
you and Miss A-Luo should

66
00:03:41,345 --> 00:03:43,025
build a little friendship.

67
00:03:43,585 --> 00:03:46,025
Learn more about the customs
of Wangxian Valley.

68
00:03:46,585 --> 00:03:47,425
What were you thinking?

69
00:03:51,785 --> 00:03:52,625
Old Huang.

70
00:03:53,225 --> 00:03:56,025
-Don't tell me you want to...
-I don't!

71
00:03:59,185 --> 00:04:00,385
Daning's lands are magnificent.

72
00:04:01,345 --> 00:04:03,025
There is the fairyland
of Wangxian Valley,

73
00:04:03,705 --> 00:04:04,985
and the vastness of Shazhou.

74
00:04:05,065 --> 00:04:06,265
Across this splendid realm,

75
00:04:08,145 --> 00:04:09,025
there are still

76
00:04:09,105 --> 00:04:10,505
so many sights I have never seen.

77
00:04:14,705 --> 00:04:15,585
In the blink of an eye,

78
00:04:15,665 --> 00:04:17,345
I've been away from Shazhou
for a long time too.

79
00:04:17,825 --> 00:04:19,745
Were you born in Shazhou?

80
00:04:20,585 --> 00:04:22,505
Or were you taken there
by traffickers?

81
00:04:23,145 --> 00:04:24,025
I don't remember.

82
00:04:24,505 --> 00:04:25,905
For as long as I can remember,

83
00:04:26,545 --> 00:04:27,945
I've lived in Shazhou.

84
00:04:29,145 --> 00:04:30,185
What about your parents?

85
00:04:30,865 --> 00:04:32,025
Do you remember them at all?

86
00:04:33,185 --> 00:04:34,265
Everything from before...

87
00:04:34,345 --> 00:04:35,545
I can't remember any of it.

88
00:04:36,145 --> 00:04:37,145
Why do I feel

89
00:04:37,825 --> 00:04:40,585
Your Majesty keeps asking
about my past lately?

90
00:04:41,585 --> 00:04:42,905
As though you're investigating me.

91
00:04:45,665 --> 00:04:47,545
Am I not allowed to be curious about you?

92
00:04:53,465 --> 00:04:54,505
As for my past,

93
00:04:55,185 --> 00:04:56,785
doesn't Your Majesty already know it well?

94
00:04:56,865 --> 00:04:58,305
Precisely because I've seen darkness,

95
00:04:59,665 --> 00:05:01,825
I am determined to uproot it completely.

96
00:05:39,145 --> 00:05:40,305
Rest here for a while.

97
00:05:40,385 --> 00:05:41,505
I'll find us something to eat.

98
00:06:03,505 --> 00:06:04,545
Here.

99
00:06:04,625 --> 00:06:06,505
Mountain fruit is best freshly picked.

100
00:06:07,185 --> 00:06:08,265
Have some to tide you over.

101
00:06:13,945 --> 00:06:15,025
How is it?

102
00:06:16,105 --> 00:06:17,225
So sweet.

103
00:06:22,945 --> 00:06:24,025
Want one?

104
00:06:24,545 --> 00:06:25,665
You eat it.

105
00:06:26,905 --> 00:06:29,065
-It's so cold.
-I'll add more firewood.

106
00:06:50,745 --> 00:06:51,745
What's wrong?

107
00:06:52,465 --> 00:06:53,505
I'm so hot.

108
00:06:54,905 --> 00:06:55,945
It's freezing out here.

109
00:06:56,025 --> 00:06:57,065
Don't catch a chill.

110
00:07:22,985 --> 00:07:25,105
I've never seen Your Majesty
this close before.

111
00:07:25,185 --> 00:07:26,745
You seem

112
00:07:27,825 --> 00:07:29,465
different from usual today.

113
00:07:35,865 --> 00:07:36,945
What's wrong?

114
00:07:42,585 --> 00:07:43,425
What's happening?

115
00:07:58,425 --> 00:07:59,345
Try one.

116
00:08:18,785 --> 00:08:19,665
Don't eat any more.

117
00:08:20,305 --> 00:08:21,425
There's something wrong with this fruit.

118
00:08:33,425 --> 00:08:34,705
Do you still know

119
00:08:35,305 --> 00:08:36,265
who you are?

120
00:08:41,665 --> 00:08:43,345
Then look at me. Who am I?

121
00:08:49,665 --> 00:08:50,505
Meng Tinghui.

122
00:08:52,905 --> 00:08:54,265
A minister who seduces her sovereign

123
00:08:55,345 --> 00:08:57,065
should be sentenced
to death by a thousand cuts.

124
00:08:57,625 --> 00:08:58,705
If you come any closer,

125
00:09:00,345 --> 00:09:02,265
we'll both be beyond redemption.

126
00:09:03,105 --> 00:09:04,505
A sovereign who indulges his minister

127
00:09:05,905 --> 00:09:07,705
should write an edict
of self-reproach.

128
00:09:10,305 --> 00:09:12,065
Is Your Majesty afraid?

129
00:09:14,465 --> 00:09:16,305
I have never been afraid.

130
00:09:17,345 --> 00:09:19,065
Neither have I.

131
00:09:37,425 --> 00:09:38,465
My lord.

132
00:10:03,265 --> 00:10:05,425
Miss Shen, you're back.

133
00:10:05,505 --> 00:10:06,345
Come sit down.

134
00:10:09,465 --> 00:10:10,305
Sister.

135
00:10:13,785 --> 00:10:14,625
Give it to me.

136
00:10:14,705 --> 00:10:15,745
-Careful, it's hot.
-Thank you.

137
00:10:16,345 --> 00:10:17,185
Sister.

138
00:10:17,265 --> 00:10:18,105
Thank you.

139
00:10:18,185 --> 00:10:19,625
Young Master Shen, you're back too.

140
00:10:19,705 --> 00:10:20,545
Come sit down.

141
00:10:20,625 --> 00:10:21,945
I give up on you.

142
00:10:22,025 --> 00:10:24,065
I've never met anyone
this hopeless with directions.

143
00:10:25,145 --> 00:10:26,625
We didn't find a single herb all day.

144
00:10:27,185 --> 00:10:28,385
My legs are about to fall off.

145
00:10:30,225 --> 00:10:33,025
You kept complaining you were tired,
so we stopped again and again.

146
00:10:33,105 --> 00:10:33,945
Otherwise, we'd have been back long ago.

147
00:10:35,665 --> 00:10:36,625
Young Master is back.

148
00:10:38,385 --> 00:10:39,225
Mengmeng.

149
00:10:40,625 --> 00:10:41,545
You're back.

150
00:10:44,385 --> 00:10:45,665
What's wrong?

151
00:10:45,905 --> 00:10:46,785
Why is your face so red?

152
00:10:55,545 --> 00:10:57,665
I picked lots of fresh wild fruit.

153
00:10:57,745 --> 00:10:58,745
They'll quench everyone's thirst.

154
00:11:02,785 --> 00:11:04,465
-You should've come sooner.
-These...

155
00:11:04,545 --> 00:11:05,785
Fuzhi.

156
00:11:06,905 --> 00:11:07,905
-Don't eat them!
-Don't eat them!

157
00:11:10,985 --> 00:11:12,025
Why can't I eat them?

158
00:11:13,745 --> 00:11:14,585
These...

159
00:11:15,065 --> 00:11:16,265
These are Love Fruits.

160
00:11:16,345 --> 00:11:19,985
Couples eat them when trying to conceive.

161
00:11:25,065 --> 00:11:27,025
These wild fruits all look alike.

162
00:11:27,105 --> 00:11:27,985
Young Master,

163
00:11:28,065 --> 00:11:29,665
how did you two recognize them?

164
00:11:34,625 --> 00:11:35,745
I have good news for everyone.

165
00:11:36,905 --> 00:11:37,745
The Fuqing Grass...

166
00:11:38,425 --> 00:11:39,265
We found it.

167
00:11:42,865 --> 00:11:44,185
Why didn't you say so earlier?

168
00:11:44,265 --> 00:11:45,825
Well...

169
00:11:46,905 --> 00:11:47,945
Enough. Don't say it.

170
00:11:51,585 --> 00:11:52,425
A-Luo.

171
00:11:53,665 --> 00:11:55,665
Do you recognize this Fuqing Grass?

172
00:11:58,145 --> 00:11:59,145
Fuqing Grass?

173
00:11:59,225 --> 00:12:01,425
We call it Moneywort in the valley.

174
00:12:01,505 --> 00:12:02,385
Every household

175
00:12:02,465 --> 00:12:04,185
grows it deep in the valley.

176
00:12:10,025 --> 00:12:11,225
Miss A-Luo.

177
00:12:11,905 --> 00:12:12,865
There's something

178
00:12:13,465 --> 00:12:14,425
we need to tell you.

179
00:12:17,465 --> 00:12:19,185
The herb merchant surnamed Lü told us

180
00:12:19,265 --> 00:12:20,105
Moneywort

181
00:12:20,185 --> 00:12:22,185
was a rare and precious medicinal herb.

182
00:12:22,265 --> 00:12:24,185
That's why we began growing it in bulk.

183
00:12:24,265 --> 00:12:25,465
We villagers

184
00:12:25,545 --> 00:12:27,225
only wanted to live off the land

185
00:12:27,305 --> 00:12:29,585
and trade herbs for money
to cover our needs.

186
00:12:29,665 --> 00:12:30,785
We never imagined

187
00:12:31,425 --> 00:12:33,305
they would use the Moneywort

188
00:12:33,385 --> 00:12:35,225
to do so many terrible things.

189
00:12:35,705 --> 00:12:37,585
Miss A-Luo, don't be alarmed.

190
00:12:37,665 --> 00:12:39,065
We're telling you the truth

191
00:12:39,145 --> 00:12:41,305
because we believe the villagers
were exploited by criminals.

192
00:12:42,265 --> 00:12:43,745
Seven days ago,

193
00:12:43,825 --> 00:12:45,865
my brother was the one
who delivered the herbs.

194
00:12:46,425 --> 00:12:48,105
I thought he had gone hunting.

195
00:12:49,025 --> 00:12:49,865
Do you think

196
00:12:51,585 --> 00:12:52,585
he might have...?

197
00:12:52,665 --> 00:12:54,465
Miss A-Luo, don't worry.

198
00:12:54,545 --> 00:12:55,545
We came here

199
00:12:55,625 --> 00:12:57,265
to uncover the true mastermind

200
00:12:57,865 --> 00:12:59,425
and wipe out the entire criminal ring.

201
00:12:59,505 --> 00:13:00,425
Tomorrow,

202
00:13:00,505 --> 00:13:01,745
we must follow this herb shipment

203
00:13:01,825 --> 00:13:03,585
straight into their lair.

204
00:13:05,225 --> 00:13:07,345
I'll help you fight those villains.

205
00:13:07,905 --> 00:13:10,545
Normally, we deliver herbs
at the start of each month.

206
00:13:11,105 --> 00:13:12,865
But we just received word

207
00:13:12,945 --> 00:13:14,945
that the merchant urgently wants
our entire stock.

208
00:13:15,665 --> 00:13:17,785
It must be delivered tomorrow morning.

209
00:13:21,705 --> 00:13:23,905
A-Luo, come prepare the flowers.

210
00:13:27,665 --> 00:13:28,625
Miss A-Luo.

211
00:13:28,705 --> 00:13:30,065
This matter is extremely serious.

212
00:13:30,825 --> 00:13:32,025
Don't let word of it leak.

213
00:13:33,305 --> 00:13:34,465
Don't worry, Miss Meng.

214
00:13:34,545 --> 00:13:35,985
I know what's at stake.

215
00:13:36,865 --> 00:13:38,105
You can make your plans.

216
00:13:38,825 --> 00:13:39,985
I'll...

217
00:13:40,065 --> 00:13:41,665
go deal with things outside.

218
00:13:51,345 --> 00:13:53,345
Ling Yunfei and the remnants
of the Tiger's Roar Gang

219
00:13:53,425 --> 00:13:55,385
are very likely hiding
at the poison-making lair.

220
00:13:57,465 --> 00:13:59,705
Your Majesty, I received a secret report.

221
00:13:59,785 --> 00:14:01,145
Wangxian Valley's terrain is complex.

222
00:14:01,225 --> 00:14:02,985
The main Divine Guard force
was delayed on the road.

223
00:14:03,065 --> 00:14:04,185
They won't arrive until noon tomorrow.

224
00:14:04,785 --> 00:14:06,665
But the merchant is trading
first thing tomorrow morning.

225
00:14:06,745 --> 00:14:07,825
If we wait for the main force,

226
00:14:07,905 --> 00:14:09,465
we'll certainly miss our chance.

227
00:14:09,545 --> 00:14:10,785
A-Luo's brother

228
00:14:10,865 --> 00:14:12,425
and the villagers who recently vanished

229
00:14:12,505 --> 00:14:14,065
may have been taken hostage.

230
00:14:14,625 --> 00:14:15,505
Every extra day they're held

231
00:14:15,585 --> 00:14:16,585
puts them in greater danger.

232
00:14:16,665 --> 00:14:18,145
The situation has changed.

233
00:14:18,225 --> 00:14:19,225
Your Majesty, please decide.

234
00:14:20,025 --> 00:14:21,105
Di Nian.

235
00:14:21,185 --> 00:14:22,145
Leave the valley tonight.

236
00:14:22,225 --> 00:14:23,265
At any cost,

237
00:14:23,345 --> 00:14:24,945
bring the Divine Guard here
as quickly as possible.

238
00:14:25,505 --> 00:14:27,905
Zhishu, take Zhili and Fuzhi

239
00:14:27,985 --> 00:14:29,905
and remain here to protect the villagers

240
00:14:29,985 --> 00:14:30,945
and provide support.

241
00:14:31,585 --> 00:14:32,905
-I obey.
-I obey.

242
00:14:33,665 --> 00:14:34,665
What about Mengmeng?

243
00:14:34,745 --> 00:14:36,985
The plan stands,
but we must change our approach.

244
00:14:37,065 --> 00:14:38,985
Tomorrow we'll disguise ourselves
as villagers delivering herbs

245
00:14:39,065 --> 00:14:40,145
and infiltrate first,

246
00:14:40,225 --> 00:14:41,705
buying time for Di Nian
and the Divine Guard.

247
00:14:43,025 --> 00:14:43,945
If Lord Meng is going,

248
00:14:44,025 --> 00:14:45,145
I'm going too.

249
00:14:46,625 --> 00:14:48,305
Tomorrow, we will capture Ling Yunfei

250
00:14:49,025 --> 00:14:50,825
and destroy the Infinity Pills.

251
00:15:03,265 --> 00:15:05,465
That damned emperor and Meng Tinghui

252
00:15:05,545 --> 00:15:06,665
have already found Wangxian Valley.

253
00:15:06,745 --> 00:15:09,185
Tomorrow they'll infiltrate
Poisoned Men Tomb.

254
00:15:09,265 --> 00:15:11,185
Sir has deliberately let them investigate.

255
00:15:11,265 --> 00:15:12,785
We've already produced
a large batch of Infinity Pills.

256
00:15:12,865 --> 00:15:15,865
-If they destroy the Tomb too...
-That would actually...

257
00:15:15,945 --> 00:15:17,385
be exactly what Sir wants.

258
00:15:17,465 --> 00:15:20,545
Sir originally planned to profit
secretly from the Infinity Pills.

259
00:15:20,625 --> 00:15:22,385
But that mad dog Ling Yunfei

260
00:15:22,465 --> 00:15:24,865
will do anything to kill Meng Tinghui.

261
00:15:24,945 --> 00:15:26,625
He even dared attack Sir.

262
00:15:26,705 --> 00:15:28,185
He's long been beyond control.

263
00:15:28,265 --> 00:15:31,185
Sir has ordered the physicians
to withdraw in batches.

264
00:15:31,265 --> 00:15:32,825
Ling Yunfei and Poisoned Men Tomb

265
00:15:32,905 --> 00:15:34,425
are now expendable pieces.

266
00:15:34,505 --> 00:15:37,425
Consider them a gift for Meng Tinghui.

267
00:15:37,505 --> 00:15:38,785
Tomorrow's trap

268
00:15:39,265 --> 00:15:40,785
is designed to lure them straight in.

269
00:15:41,345 --> 00:15:43,465
Mr. Shangguan means to kill
with a borrowed blade,

270
00:15:43,545 --> 00:15:45,505
letting Ying Gua and Ling Yunfei
destroy each other.

271
00:15:45,585 --> 00:15:47,305
Whether Ling Yunfei lives or dies

272
00:15:47,385 --> 00:15:48,305
doesn't matter.

273
00:15:48,385 --> 00:15:49,465
But Ying Gua

274
00:15:50,265 --> 00:15:52,545
must die in Poisoned Men Tomb.

275
00:15:52,625 --> 00:15:55,505
Then everyone will believe
Ling Yunfei killed the emperor.

276
00:15:55,585 --> 00:15:56,945
With the realm leaderless,

277
00:15:57,025 --> 00:15:58,145
this magnificent land

278
00:15:58,225 --> 00:15:59,865
will ultimately belong to Zhongwan.

279
00:16:01,105 --> 00:16:08,105
-Kill Ying Gua!
-Kill Ying Gua!

280
00:16:19,585 --> 00:16:20,505
Keep feeding them.

281
00:16:21,465 --> 00:16:22,345
Not a single pill is to be left.

282
00:16:22,425 --> 00:16:23,825
-Yes.
-Yes.

283
00:16:25,025 --> 00:16:25,865
Chief.

284
00:16:26,625 --> 00:16:28,225
-A letter from the Right Chancellor.
-Read it.

285
00:16:28,305 --> 00:16:30,425
Meng Tinghui and the others
have been away from the capital for days.

286
00:16:30,505 --> 00:16:32,825
Stop the Infinity Pill operation at once.

287
00:16:32,905 --> 00:16:34,585
-Don't...
-Keep reading.

288
00:16:35,505 --> 00:16:36,945
Stop acting like a madman
and dragging me down with you.

289
00:16:38,305 --> 00:16:39,785
He thinks he can order me around?

290
00:16:39,865 --> 00:16:40,985
I'll do the opposite.

291
00:16:41,545 --> 00:16:42,665
Tell those physicians

292
00:16:43,225 --> 00:16:44,265
to work day and night

293
00:16:44,345 --> 00:16:45,625
and speed up production
of the Infinity Pills.

294
00:16:45,705 --> 00:16:46,585
This time,

295
00:16:46,665 --> 00:16:49,345
I'll make Meng Tinghui taste
an Infinity Pill herself

296
00:16:49,425 --> 00:16:51,625
and turn the entire capital into chaos.

297
00:16:52,505 --> 00:16:53,345
Chief.

298
00:16:53,825 --> 00:16:55,105
The Tiger's Roar Gang was raided.

299
00:16:55,185 --> 00:16:56,545
We retreated to Poisoned Men Tomb,

300
00:16:56,625 --> 00:16:58,385
and less than half our men remain.

301
00:16:58,465 --> 00:17:00,705
We shouldn't confront them head-on now.

302
00:17:00,785 --> 00:17:01,825
As long as we're alive, we can...

303
00:17:01,905 --> 00:17:02,905
What about Ruyan's revenge?

304
00:17:03,945 --> 00:17:05,425
What about your brother Lü Er's life?

305
00:17:06,105 --> 00:17:07,305
If you're afraid to die,

306
00:17:07,385 --> 00:17:08,225
get out now.

307
00:17:09,305 --> 00:17:10,345
Why would you say that, Chief?

308
00:17:10,425 --> 00:17:12,465
We've shared life and death
for more than ten years.

309
00:17:12,545 --> 00:17:14,305
When have I ever said I was afraid?

310
00:17:16,025 --> 00:17:17,225
In this lifetime,

311
00:17:17,745 --> 00:17:19,465
I, Lü Da, will never abandon you.

312
00:17:20,185 --> 00:17:21,185
All these years,

313
00:17:22,425 --> 00:17:23,825
you've risked your life for me

314
00:17:24,985 --> 00:17:27,705
and treated me better
than my own brother ever did.

315
00:17:27,785 --> 00:17:29,385
Yet the people dearest to us

316
00:17:29,465 --> 00:17:30,985
were all killed because of Meng Tinghui.

317
00:17:31,065 --> 00:17:32,665
If we don't avenge them,

318
00:17:32,745 --> 00:17:33,865
what meaning is there

319
00:17:33,945 --> 00:17:35,065
in staying alive?

320
00:17:35,625 --> 00:17:36,465
Chief.

321
00:17:37,625 --> 00:17:39,465
I know that since Sister Ruyan died,

322
00:17:40,345 --> 00:17:41,745
your heart has been in agony.

323
00:17:42,745 --> 00:17:44,905
And I want revenge for my brother
just as badly.

324
00:17:46,025 --> 00:17:47,705
Since you've made your decision,

325
00:17:48,905 --> 00:17:50,265
I'll follow you to the death.

326
00:17:57,865 --> 00:17:59,025
Good brother.

327
00:17:59,585 --> 00:18:00,545
But Chief,

328
00:18:01,145 --> 00:18:02,985
the Right Chancellor's letter says

329
00:18:03,065 --> 00:18:04,905
Meng Tinghui and the others
aren't in the capital.

330
00:18:05,585 --> 00:18:06,585
Could they

331
00:18:06,665 --> 00:18:08,105
have already traced us
to Wangxian Valley?

332
00:18:10,425 --> 00:18:11,545
This batch of Infinity Pills

333
00:18:11,625 --> 00:18:13,105
is almost complete.

334
00:18:13,185 --> 00:18:15,745
Those villagers are nothing
but a burden now.

335
00:18:16,305 --> 00:18:18,385
Once the final herbs arrive,

336
00:18:19,825 --> 00:18:21,465
take men and massacre the valley.

337
00:18:21,985 --> 00:18:23,465
Leave no loose ends.

338
00:18:26,185 --> 00:18:29,625
Every year at the Flower Festival,
we exchange flowers to show our feelings.

339
00:18:29,705 --> 00:18:30,985
These flowers are for you.

340
00:18:31,065 --> 00:18:32,745
May you all be safe and blessed.

341
00:18:34,105 --> 00:18:35,105
Thank you, Miss A-Luo.

342
00:18:35,185 --> 00:18:38,385
Then we wish Miss A-Luo
and all the villagers

343
00:18:38,465 --> 00:18:40,225
peace and good health, year after year.

344
00:18:40,305 --> 00:18:41,145
Thank you.

345
00:18:43,305 --> 00:18:44,145
Old Huang.

346
00:18:44,225 --> 00:18:45,265
What are you grinning about?

347
00:18:46,025 --> 00:18:46,865
Old Huang,

348
00:18:47,585 --> 00:18:49,745
Miss A-Luo cared for your injured leg.

349
00:18:49,825 --> 00:18:51,705
Shouldn't you give her flowers
to thank her?

350
00:18:51,785 --> 00:18:53,025
That's right, Huang Bo.

351
00:18:53,105 --> 00:18:54,545
We're leaving tomorrow.

352
00:18:55,265 --> 00:18:56,425
Go on.

353
00:18:58,505 --> 00:18:59,465
Miss A-Luo.

354
00:19:01,385 --> 00:19:02,305
No words can repay your kindness.

355
00:19:03,625 --> 00:19:04,625
Old Huang.

356
00:19:04,705 --> 00:19:07,105
Are you swearing brotherhood
with Miss A-Luo?

357
00:19:08,545 --> 00:19:09,385
A-Nian.

358
00:19:09,465 --> 00:19:11,345
Here. No words can repay your kindness.

359
00:19:11,905 --> 00:19:12,985
Thank you.

360
00:19:15,185 --> 00:19:16,225
Sister!

361
00:19:16,305 --> 00:19:18,945
-Will you swing with us, Sister?
-Hold this.

362
00:19:19,025 --> 00:19:20,185
Let's go.

363
00:19:20,265 --> 00:19:21,105
Xiaoyue.

364
00:19:21,185 --> 00:19:22,705
Let this peachwood bear witness.

365
00:19:22,785 --> 00:19:23,865
I, A-Niu, will spend my life

366
00:19:23,945 --> 00:19:25,785
admiring every season's flowers with you,

367
00:19:25,865 --> 00:19:27,545
and sharing every dawn and dusk.

368
00:19:28,425 --> 00:19:29,385
May it bind you and me,

369
00:19:29,465 --> 00:19:30,985
our hearts united forever.

370
00:19:31,625 --> 00:19:32,505
I will.

371
00:19:34,505 --> 00:19:36,225
Why did he give her that peachwood?

372
00:19:36,945 --> 00:19:38,425
It's a custom of Wangxian Valley.

373
00:19:38,505 --> 00:19:40,305
Peachwood is exchanged
to express romantic feelings.

374
00:19:42,425 --> 00:19:43,385
Zhili.

375
00:19:43,905 --> 00:19:45,665
The villagers say the Flower Festival
is for giving flowers and blessings.

376
00:19:45,745 --> 00:19:47,305
I'm leaving the valley soon.

377
00:19:47,945 --> 00:19:50,065
This flower is for you.

378
00:19:56,905 --> 00:19:58,105
A-Nian.

379
00:19:58,185 --> 00:19:59,425
With this flower,

380
00:19:59,505 --> 00:20:00,345
I wish you

381
00:20:00,425 --> 00:20:01,545
find a girl you truly love,

382
00:20:01,625 --> 00:20:03,025
so that one day

383
00:20:03,105 --> 00:20:04,345
I won't need to worry about you anymore.

384
00:20:29,025 --> 00:20:30,585
This is one of our local specialties.

385
00:20:30,665 --> 00:20:31,825
You can't even get it in the capital.

386
00:20:56,625 --> 00:20:57,625
A-Luo.

387
00:20:57,705 --> 00:20:58,665
What's wrong?

388
00:21:00,385 --> 00:21:01,785
Every year at the Flower Festival,

389
00:21:02,545 --> 00:21:04,945
my brother makes my favorite flower cakes.

390
00:21:06,585 --> 00:21:07,945
I wish he were here.

391
00:21:10,265 --> 00:21:11,865
You weave those flowers beautifully.

392
00:21:16,665 --> 00:21:17,505
Would you like to learn?

393
00:21:22,665 --> 00:21:23,745
Miss A-Luo.

394
00:21:23,825 --> 00:21:24,745
Look at this.

395
00:21:28,185 --> 00:21:30,585
Does it look bad?

396
00:21:30,665 --> 00:21:32,225
I think it's beautiful.

397
00:21:32,305 --> 00:21:33,825
It's

398
00:21:33,905 --> 00:21:35,185
the most unique flower crown
I've ever seen.

399
00:21:47,345 --> 00:21:48,545
Does it look good?

400
00:21:50,145 --> 00:21:51,345
It does.

401
00:22:00,625 --> 00:22:01,985
The festival's nearly over,

402
00:22:02,065 --> 00:22:03,105
and you still haven't given away
your flowers.

403
00:22:06,905 --> 00:22:07,865
A worthy beauty is hard to find.

404
00:22:07,945 --> 00:22:09,585
I need to choose the right moment

405
00:22:09,665 --> 00:22:10,585
to prove my sincerity.

406
00:22:11,265 --> 00:22:12,665
So...

407
00:22:12,745 --> 00:22:14,585
you had your eye on my swing.

408
00:22:14,665 --> 00:22:15,705
I'll leave it to you two.

409
00:22:18,145 --> 00:22:19,185
I've looked around.

410
00:22:19,265 --> 00:22:20,305
Of all the girls here,

411
00:22:20,385 --> 00:22:21,225
none is prettier than you.

412
00:22:21,305 --> 00:22:22,425
Shen Zhishu.

413
00:22:23,025 --> 00:22:24,785
How many girls

414
00:22:24,865 --> 00:22:26,345
have heard those sweet lines from you?

415
00:22:30,425 --> 00:22:31,265
Yes.

416
00:22:32,265 --> 00:22:33,705
I used to live recklessly,

417
00:22:34,385 --> 00:22:35,785
thinking being a playboy meant happiness.

418
00:22:37,025 --> 00:22:38,185
It wasn't until I met you

419
00:22:44,145 --> 00:22:45,305
that I learned what fear truly is.

420
00:22:46,905 --> 00:22:47,825
Afraid of what?

421
00:22:50,465 --> 00:22:51,345
Afraid to see you frown.

422
00:22:52,305 --> 00:22:53,505
Afraid you'll turn away.

423
00:22:55,345 --> 00:22:56,185
And even more afraid...

424
00:22:59,145 --> 00:23:00,385
you won't believe

425
00:23:01,945 --> 00:23:04,025
that my heart has room
for no one but you.

426
00:23:10,745 --> 00:23:12,265
Maybe right now

427
00:23:13,185 --> 00:23:14,425
you do care for me.

428
00:23:15,465 --> 00:23:17,825
But how long will those feelings last?

429
00:23:18,705 --> 00:23:20,505
There are so many noble ladies
in the capital

430
00:23:20,985 --> 00:23:22,305
all waiting for Young Lord Shen.

431
00:23:23,425 --> 00:23:24,905
Can you truly give up

432
00:23:24,985 --> 00:23:26,065
all those beauties?

433
00:23:26,865 --> 00:23:27,945
I promise you,

434
00:23:28,025 --> 00:23:29,025
if I ever flirt with another woman,

435
00:23:29,105 --> 00:23:30,025
you can leave me without hesitation.

436
00:23:32,385 --> 00:23:33,465
Will you give me

437
00:23:34,985 --> 00:23:36,225
a chance to prove myself?

438
00:23:57,545 --> 00:23:58,705
How much of your salary did this cost?

439
00:24:00,065 --> 00:24:00,905
Why waste the money?

440
00:24:01,705 --> 00:24:04,465
I'd be most afraid if you didn't know
how many years of salary this cost me.

441
00:24:04,545 --> 00:24:06,065
How else could I prove my sincerity?

442
00:24:15,465 --> 00:24:16,585
I know.

443
00:24:18,585 --> 00:24:20,065
You're afraid you'll hinder my career.

444
00:24:22,385 --> 00:24:23,985
But how could I not know
how you feel?

445
00:24:26,625 --> 00:24:27,545
And how could you

446
00:24:28,705 --> 00:24:30,025
not know how I feel?

447
00:24:50,065 --> 00:24:51,145
It suits you quite well.

448
00:24:54,185 --> 00:24:55,705
I picked it out when we first met.

449
00:24:57,945 --> 00:24:58,825
Fool.

450
00:25:04,505 --> 00:25:05,865
Does it still hurt?

451
00:25:09,065 --> 00:25:10,025
It does.

452
00:25:16,265 --> 00:25:17,705
Then you'll remember it for life.

453
00:26:24,265 --> 00:26:25,945
The Flower Festival is so lively outside.

454
00:26:26,025 --> 00:26:27,785
Why aren't you celebrating with them?

455
00:26:27,865 --> 00:26:29,625
When I look at these villagers,

456
00:26:30,145 --> 00:26:31,625
my feelings are complicated.

457
00:26:31,705 --> 00:26:33,185
They're so simple and honest.

458
00:26:34,585 --> 00:26:35,905
They only wanted to use Fuqing Grass

459
00:26:35,985 --> 00:26:37,425
to earn a little money,

460
00:26:37,505 --> 00:26:39,105
yet the Tiger's Roar Gang exploited them

461
00:26:40,185 --> 00:26:42,465
to help produce the Infinity Pills.

462
00:26:43,025 --> 00:26:44,865
As the saying goes,
it isn't the blade that kills,

463
00:26:45,545 --> 00:26:46,825
but the person wielding it.

464
00:26:48,345 --> 00:26:49,825
Fuqing Grass itself isn't frightening.

465
00:26:50,305 --> 00:26:52,305
What's frightening is those
who use it with evil intent.

466
00:27:50,385 --> 00:27:51,505
Follow this mountain path

467
00:27:51,585 --> 00:27:52,665
about five kilometers ahead.

468
00:27:52,745 --> 00:27:55,625
That's where we trade herbs
with the merchant.

469
00:27:55,705 --> 00:27:57,105
The mountain road is rough,

470
00:27:57,185 --> 00:27:58,345
so you'll need to travel through the night.

471
00:27:58,905 --> 00:28:00,065
As for my brother...

472
00:28:00,865 --> 00:28:01,865
I'm entrusting him to you.

473
00:28:01,945 --> 00:28:03,425
Don't worry, Miss A-Luo.

474
00:28:04,185 --> 00:28:05,705
We'll do everything we can

475
00:28:05,785 --> 00:28:07,065
to find out where your brother is.

476
00:28:07,145 --> 00:28:08,305
Don't worry.

477
00:28:10,945 --> 00:28:12,025
Your leg still hasn't healed.

478
00:28:12,865 --> 00:28:13,865
Please be careful.

479
00:28:16,505 --> 00:28:17,825
I embroidered this sachet.

480
00:28:17,905 --> 00:28:19,065
My brother has one too.

481
00:28:19,145 --> 00:28:20,225
I hope

482
00:28:20,905 --> 00:28:22,545
both of you return safe and sound.

483
00:28:27,865 --> 00:28:28,945
Miss A-Luo.

484
00:28:29,865 --> 00:28:32,265
I don't have anything with me
to give you.

485
00:28:33,265 --> 00:28:34,265
When I come back next time,

486
00:28:34,865 --> 00:28:36,465
I'll weave you a beautiful flower crown.

487
00:28:38,305 --> 00:28:39,545
I'll wait for you.

488
00:28:41,345 --> 00:28:42,625
It's getting late.

489
00:28:42,705 --> 00:28:43,545
We should set out.

490
00:29:09,545 --> 00:29:10,425
Gentlemen.

491
00:29:10,505 --> 00:29:12,385
All four crates of Fuqing Grass are here.

492
00:29:12,465 --> 00:29:13,385
Please inspect them.

493
00:29:13,465 --> 00:29:14,465
We've been watching you two for a while.

494
00:29:14,545 --> 00:29:15,465
We've never seen you before.

495
00:29:16,105 --> 00:29:17,425
The two of us

496
00:29:17,505 --> 00:29:18,705
are from this val...

497
00:29:19,225 --> 00:29:20,665
Looking to die?

498
00:29:20,745 --> 00:29:21,945
Sir, please calm down.

499
00:29:22,025 --> 00:29:24,745
It's my brother's first herb delivery.
He doesn't know the rules.

500
00:29:30,785 --> 00:29:32,745
All the herbs are here.

501
00:29:33,225 --> 00:29:34,465
Then this...

502
00:29:36,625 --> 00:29:37,585
Get lost.

503
00:29:37,665 --> 00:29:38,545
Right away.

504
00:29:39,625 --> 00:29:40,545
May you prosper, sir.

505
00:29:49,625 --> 00:29:50,465
Quickly.

506
00:29:50,545 --> 00:29:51,905
Move all the ingredients
to the storehouse.

507
00:30:43,585 --> 00:30:44,545
There's nothing here.

508
00:30:45,465 --> 00:30:46,905
Have they already sent them
to the capital?

509
00:30:48,105 --> 00:30:49,705
Looks like they know we're onto them.

510
00:30:54,825 --> 00:30:55,745
Lord Meng.

511
00:30:57,105 --> 00:30:58,585
You're looking for the Infinity Pills,
aren't you?

512
00:31:00,425 --> 00:31:01,545
I brought them for you.

513
00:31:04,625 --> 00:31:06,465
Today we'll wipe out this poison den

514
00:31:07,105 --> 00:31:08,345
and take you back to the capital for trial.

515
00:31:08,425 --> 00:31:10,545
You walk into my territory

516
00:31:10,625 --> 00:31:12,585
and still dare talk so big?

517
00:31:12,665 --> 00:31:14,945
I've ordered the Divine Guard
to surround this place.

518
00:31:15,745 --> 00:31:16,865
You think you can use Infinity Pills
to throw the capital into chaos?

519
00:31:17,425 --> 00:31:18,465
Keep dreaming.

520
00:31:18,545 --> 00:31:21,145
Even the emperor of Daning came.

521
00:31:21,225 --> 00:31:22,305
But your law

522
00:31:22,385 --> 00:31:24,025
doesn't reach Poisoned Men Tomb.

523
00:31:40,105 --> 00:31:41,625
Do you see?

524
00:31:41,705 --> 00:31:43,945
They've been tempered
with massive doses of Infinity Pills.

525
00:31:44,025 --> 00:31:45,745
They've gone from drugged subjects
to poison-fueled killers.

526
00:31:46,585 --> 00:31:48,305
If they appeared on the capital's streets,

527
00:31:49,225 --> 00:31:51,185
what a magnificent sight that would be.

528
00:31:51,265 --> 00:31:52,465
Before long, the entire capital

529
00:31:52,545 --> 00:31:54,385
will become my living hell.

530
00:31:54,465 --> 00:31:56,545
Every citizen will die with you.

531
00:33:40,825 --> 00:33:41,865
I embroidered this sachet.

532
00:33:41,945 --> 00:33:43,265
My brother has one too.

533
00:33:43,345 --> 00:33:44,465
A-Luo's brother.

534
00:34:01,105 --> 00:34:02,345
So much time has passed.

535
00:34:04,145 --> 00:34:06,145
I wonder if things are going smoothly
for Mengmeng.

536
00:34:08,865 --> 00:34:10,585
I heard honey water relieves fatigue
and helps you sleep.

537
00:34:10,665 --> 00:34:11,945
I mixed it specially with warm water.

538
00:34:12,025 --> 00:34:13,945
Not too hot, not too cold. Try it.

539
00:34:16,385 --> 00:34:17,545
Shen Zhishu, you're cheating!

540
00:34:40,185 --> 00:34:41,225
This is what cheating looks like.

541
00:34:42,625 --> 00:34:43,705
Brother.

542
00:34:45,425 --> 00:34:46,545
You two...

543
00:34:47,345 --> 00:34:49,025
It's exactly what you saw.

544
00:34:49,105 --> 00:34:50,145
We're together now.

545
00:34:56,545 --> 00:34:58,025
I knew long ago

546
00:34:58,105 --> 00:34:59,225
that you two would end up together.

547
00:34:59,945 --> 00:35:01,145
But seeing you now,

548
00:35:01,225 --> 00:35:02,505
so inseparable

549
00:35:02,585 --> 00:35:03,745
and so lovey-dovey,

550
00:35:03,825 --> 00:35:05,385
really is more than I expected.

551
00:35:05,945 --> 00:35:07,665
If you're jealous, go find someone yourself.

552
00:35:10,185 --> 00:35:12,065
-Sweet?
-Sweet.

553
00:35:12,665 --> 00:35:14,745
Young Master Shen. Miss Shen.

554
00:35:15,305 --> 00:35:16,305
Miss A-Luo.

555
00:35:16,385 --> 00:35:17,225
Something's wrong.

556
00:35:17,305 --> 00:35:19,585
I just saw several strangers
outside the valley.

557
00:35:19,665 --> 00:35:21,785
They looked like the people
who tricked us into selling Fuqing Grass.

558
00:35:23,265 --> 00:35:24,105
Miss A-Luo.

559
00:35:24,185 --> 00:35:25,025
You villagers don't know martial arts.

560
00:35:25,105 --> 00:35:27,065
Is there somewhere safe to hide?

561
00:35:27,145 --> 00:35:30,265
Yes. Deep in the valley,
there's an abandoned watchtower.

562
00:35:30,345 --> 00:35:32,225
The villagers usually rest there.

563
00:35:32,985 --> 00:35:34,025
The tower is easy to defend.

564
00:35:34,105 --> 00:35:35,025
Take everyone there and hide at once.

565
00:35:35,105 --> 00:35:36,305
I'll notify the villagers immediately.

566
00:35:36,385 --> 00:35:37,465
I'll go with you.

567
00:35:38,145 --> 00:35:38,985
Don't worry.

568
00:35:39,065 --> 00:35:40,345
I'll meet up with you soon.

569
00:35:40,425 --> 00:35:42,425
Brother, be careful.

570
00:35:42,505 --> 00:35:43,705
Remember to drink it.

571
00:36:01,505 --> 00:36:02,345
Hurry!

572
00:36:03,945 --> 00:36:05,065
Move!

573
00:36:05,145 --> 00:36:07,105
-Hurry!
-Move! Kneel down!

574
00:36:07,825 --> 00:36:09,665
Don't hit my sister!

575
00:36:09,745 --> 00:36:10,865
The Chief gave orders.

576
00:36:11,505 --> 00:36:12,545
No harming children.

577
00:36:13,825 --> 00:36:16,465
Please, good sirs, spare our lives.

578
00:36:17,025 --> 00:36:18,665
We're only farmers.

579
00:36:24,025 --> 00:36:26,345
-Farmers?
-Farmers.

580
00:36:26,425 --> 00:36:27,865
Perfect.

581
00:36:28,065 --> 00:36:29,865
Your corpse can fertilize the fields.

582
00:36:34,465 --> 00:36:35,825
A-Niu!

583
00:36:39,665 --> 00:36:40,865
A-Niu!

584
00:36:45,185 --> 00:36:46,025
Stop!

585
00:36:50,385 --> 00:36:51,385
Young Lord Shen.

586
00:36:52,825 --> 00:36:54,025
You're quite clever.

587
00:36:54,545 --> 00:36:56,065
You even managed to find this place.

588
00:36:57,105 --> 00:36:58,905
You spare neither the old nor weak,
women nor children.

589
00:36:59,505 --> 00:37:01,465
The Tiger's Roar Gang is lower
than beasts.

590
00:37:02,025 --> 00:37:04,065
Every one of these lives is worthless.

591
00:37:04,145 --> 00:37:05,465
What does it matter if they die?

592
00:37:06,065 --> 00:37:07,945
Everyone here dies today,

593
00:37:08,505 --> 00:37:09,345
including you.

594
00:37:10,505 --> 00:37:11,345
Kill him!

595
00:37:56,945 --> 00:37:57,865
After him!

596
00:37:57,945 --> 00:37:58,785
Go!

597
00:38:03,985 --> 00:38:04,905
Everyone, get up.

598
00:38:05,745 --> 00:38:06,745
You're safe now.

599
00:38:11,465 --> 00:38:14,665
-Thank you, Lord Shen.
-Thank you, Lord Shen.

600
00:38:14,745 --> 00:38:16,185
Thank you, Lord Shen.

601
00:38:16,265 --> 00:38:17,105
Go home now.

602
00:38:17,865 --> 00:38:18,825
Go on.

603
00:38:53,505 --> 00:38:54,345
Your Majesty.

604
00:38:56,465 --> 00:38:58,425
The guards in the side passage
delayed us for a while.

605
00:38:58,505 --> 00:39:00,305
-We arrived too late.
-It's fine.

606
00:39:00,385 --> 00:39:01,785
They've already moved
the Infinity Pills out.

607
00:39:01,865 --> 00:39:04,305
Yinqing, search this place
for any Infinity Pills left behind.

608
00:39:04,385 --> 00:39:05,985
Destroy every last one.

609
00:39:06,065 --> 00:39:06,905
Huang Bo.

610
00:39:06,985 --> 00:39:08,225
Come with me to hold Ling Yunfei off.

611
00:39:08,305 --> 00:39:09,625
Yes.

612
00:39:25,425 --> 00:39:27,265
Even that couldn't kill you.

613
00:39:27,345 --> 00:39:28,705
Ling Yunfei.

614
00:39:29,105 --> 00:39:30,545
You have slaughtered my people

615
00:39:30,625 --> 00:39:31,705
and brought ruin upon Daning.

616
00:39:31,785 --> 00:39:33,865
Your crimes cannot be atoned for
even with ten thousand deaths.

617
00:39:34,785 --> 00:39:36,625
Today is your day to die.

618
00:39:36,705 --> 00:39:37,785
Kill them!

619
00:40:20,545 --> 00:40:21,705
Your Majesty, watch out!

